      "Language": "ger",
      "Abstract": {"AbstractText": "The diagnostics of acute appendicitis is also a challenge for a surgeon today. The question of suitable, supplement diagnostics methods is topical. Experience with percutan sonography in the hand of surgeon in one-year-study are demonstrated and possibilities, problems and views should be to show. In skilled hand the sonography is an easy, little burden and helpful method to determinate right lower pain."},
